flowchart TD
  A[Webhook or poll hint] --> B[Verify source and deduplicate]
  B --> C[Acquire mailbox lease]
  C --> D[Load committed cursor]
  D --> E[Fetch provider changes]
  E --> F{Cursor valid?}
  F -- No --> G[Schedule full reconciliation]
  F -- Yes --> H[Normalize and deduplicate]
  G --> H
  H --> I[Commit changes and cursor atomically]
  I --> J[Audit and release lease]
